<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Cimpor boosts profit.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Cimpor boosts profit.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending Dec 31</p>
<p>(In billions of escudos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons net profit	   19.7	vs     18.4</p>
<p>    Gross dividend	 125 escudos  vs  115 escudos</p>
<p>Cons net excluding extraordinaries</p>
<p>    and revaluations		  21.1    vs   18.1</p>
<p>Operating profit (before revaluations) 29.9 vs 27.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		    128.3   vs  118.7</p>
<p>The company said that the net profit on the sale of its stake in Banco Fomento &amp; Exterior was 7.7 billion.  </p>
<p>Note - Company name is Cimpor-Cimentos de Portugal.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
